{"3151360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Agni: Village of Calamity", "steam_appid": 3151360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/f0145bcc93f20fdb46a6ebfb23c7d875.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AGNI: Village of Calamity</strong> is a cinematic survival horror, combining mind-bending terror and ritual strangeness, with Indonesian slasher style violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/489eba2d24b05f44fb3ddc7c2370def3.poster.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/489eba2d24b05f44fb3ddc7c2370def3.webm?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/489eba2d24b05f44fb3ddc7c2370def3.mp4?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Agni, an investigator from a secret Agency, driven by regret, who disobeys the rules, as she searches for her missing partner inside the forbidden village, Desa Purba.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/492f41baccb5a22ef438db5a20024c77.poster.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/492f41baccb5a22ef438db5a20024c77.webm?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/492f41baccb5a22ef438db5a20024c77.mp4?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On this rogue mission, Agni descends deeper into violence, obsession, and psychological collapse as the guilt drives her towards the edge of what the human mind can live through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/45e42cb4b48bb0ddc2b02d0ae159d6b6.poster.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/45e42cb4b48bb0ddc2b02d0ae159d6b6.webm?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/45e42cb4b48bb0ddc2b02d0ae159d6b6.mp4?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Operating with limited resources, Agni must solve environmental puzzles and survive relentless pressure as grotesque horrors stalk her through the darkness. Every encounter is dangerous. Every bullet matters.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/bf997ea08536fa1ee2284264ad6577f1.poster.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/bf997ea08536fa1ee2284264ad6577f1.webm?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/bf997ea08536fa1ee2284264ad6577f1.mp4?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inspired by Indonesian horror films, AGNI: Village of Calamity delivers a suffocating descent into trauma and grief, where reality is unstable, violence is brutal, and some truths should never be uncovered.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/94b22d4ebb18f02de850e61ae46dd923.poster.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/94b22d4ebb18f02de850e61ae46dd923.webm?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/94b22d4ebb18f02de850e61ae46dd923.mp4?t=1781265274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/f0145bcc93f20fdb46a6ebfb23c7d875.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AGNI: Village of Calamity</strong> is a cinematic survival horror, combining mind-bending terror and ritual strangeness, with Indonesian slasher style violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/489eba2d24b05f44fb3ddc7c2370def3.poster.avif?t=1781265274\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151360/extras/489eba2d24b05f44fb3